  "Question": "Cagney can frost a cupcake every \\(20\\) seconds and Lacey can frost a cupcake every \\(30\\) seconds. Working together, how many cupcakes can they frost in \\(5\\) minutes?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(10\\)",
    "B": "\\(15\\)",
    "C": "\\(20\\)",
    "D": "\\(25\\)",
    "E": "\\(30\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Solution": "Both people work for the full \\(5\\) minutes, which is \\(5\\cdot60=300\\) seconds. Divide this time by each person's time per cupcake: Cagney frosts \\(300\\div20=15\\) cupcakes, and Lacey frosts \\(300\\div30=10\\). Adding their contributions gives\n\\[\n15+10=\\boxed{25}\n\\]\ncupcakes, choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
